  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CORE FUNDING TO MISEAN CARA, WHICH PROVIDES GRANTS TO MISSIONARY ORGANISATIONS FOR THEIR DEVELOPMENT WORK IN AFRICA, ASIA AND SOUTH AMERICA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PARTNER: Spiritans PROJECT: Supporting basic health care for vulnerable communities. The upgrading of the health facility from a dispensary to a health centre will unlock the broader health services required by the community. It will offer comprehensive health care, for chronic diseases such as diabetes, hypertension, tuberculosis and HIV&amp;AIDS management. There will also be mother and child wellness care for the health of both the mother and new-born before and after birth.</narrative>
  </description>
